  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s memory of his previous life in Western Desert, an ancient desolate thousand wish tree draws a huge battle when its fruits ripen. Super forces try to partition the tree, then smaller forces break their blockade.",
        "chapters": [
          673
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "reg_western_desert",
          "sys_super_force"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A lone cultivator rank five Gu Master with the surname Han and name Li reaches the tree first. His wish yields the space path Immortal Gu Phantom Heaven.",
        "chapters": [
          673
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wish-reward",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan is a rank four Gu Master seeking profit in that chaos. By the time he reaches the tree, only fifty or sixty fruits remain, and he obtains a rare rank four Gu rather than an Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          673
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wish-reward",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The tree finishes growing in three hundred years, flowers at six hundred, and bears exactly one thousand fruits at nine hundred. When the fruits ripen, people can bring Gu recipes and wish under the tree. Successful wishes open fruits that release mortal or Immortal Gu, and a successful Immortal Gu wish reduces the fruit count accordingly.",
        "chapters": [
          673
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "growth-cycle-and-wish-mechanic",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
